  volume   =  318,
  number   =  14,
  pages    = "1377--1384",
  abstract = "Accurate information regarding prognosis is fundamental to optimal
              clinical care. The best approach to assess patient prognosis
              relies on prediction models that simultaneously consider a number
              of prognostic factors and provide an estimate of patients'
              absolute risk of an event. Such prediction models should be
