  volume   =  28,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "766--776",
  abstract = "PURPOSE: Given current efforts to enhance patient-centered care
              and shared decision-making, the International Society of
              Pharmacoepidemiology Workgroup on Patient Engagement assessed
              patient and other stakeholder engagement in pharmacoepidemiology
              research and provides recommendations for the field. METHODS: A
