  abstract  = "When designing a randomized clinical trial to compare two
               treatments, the sample size required to have desired power with a
               specified type 1 error depends on the hypothesis testing
               procedure. With a binary endpoint (e.g., response), the trial
               results can be displayed in a 2 × 2 table. If one does the
               analysis conditional on the number of positive responses, then
