              hazard functions themselves are of primary interest, or when
              relative times instead of relative hazards are the relevant
              measures of association. Parametric regression models are an
              attractive option in situations such as this, although the choice
              of a particular model from the available families of distributions
              can be problematic. The generalized gamma (GG) distribution is an
