              practical recommendations help to conquer the complexity.
              Centering, scaling, and full-rank coding of all the predictor
              variables radically improve the chances of convergence, computing
              speed, and numerical accuracy. Applying computational and
              assumption diagnostics from univariate linear models to mixed
              model data greatly helps to detect and solve the related
              computational problems. Applying computational and assumption
