              two proportions into one for the comparison of the means of the
              underlying continuous outcomes. This demonstrates how much the
              sample size may be reduced if the outcome were not dichotomized.
              We also provide a method to calculate the loss of information
              after a dichotomization. We apply this method to all the trials
