              of conditional randomization tests to multiple comparisons. The
              view is taken that the linkage of the statistical test to the
              experimental design (randomization procedure) should be
              recognized. A selected collection of randomization procedures
              generalized to multiarmed treatment allocation is summarized, and
              generalizations for two randomization procedures that heretofore
              were designed for only two treatments are developed. We explain
