  author   = "Ocampo, Alex and Bather, Jemar R",
  journal  = "Stat. Med.",
  volume   =  42,
  number   =  21,
  pages    = "3892--3902",
  abstract = "Confusion often arises when attempting to articulate target
              estimand(s) of a clinical trial in plain language. We aim to
              rectify this confusion by using a type of causal graph called the
              Single-World Intervention Graph (SWIG) to provide a visual
              representation of the estimand that can be effectively
              communicated to interdisciplinary stakeholders. These graphs not
