              criteria were identified and synthesised in a white paper.
              EVIDENCE SYNTHESIS: The METastasis Reporting and Data System for
              Prostate Cancer guidelines were formulated for use in all
              oncologic manifestations of APC. CONCLUSIONS: Uniformity in
              imaging data acquisition, quality, and interpretation of WB-MRI
