              list of issues to be addressed in reports on evaluation studies
              was drafted based on experiences as editors and reviewers of
              journals in Health Informatics and as authors of systematic
              reviews of Health Informatics studies, taking into account
              guidelines for reporting of medical research. This list has been
              discussed in several rounds by an increasing number of experts in
