  pages    = "695--702",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVES: Adjudication committees (ACs) are recommended in
              randomized controlled trials (RCTs) to standardize the assessment
              of events. We aimed to assess the reporting and functioning of ACs
              (synonyms: clinical event committees, endpoint committees) in
