              recommendation-determinants of a recommendation's direction and
              strength",
  author   = "Andrews, Jeffrey C and Schünemann, Holger J and Oxman, Andrew D
              and Pottie, Kevin and Meerpohl, Joerg J and Coello, Pablo Alonso
              and Rind, David and Montori, Victor M and Brito, Juan Pablo and
