              Santesso, Nancy and Neumann, Ignacio and Mustafa, Reem A and
              Mbuagbaw, Lawrence and Etxeandia Ikobaltzeta, Itziar and De Stio,
              Catherine and McCullagh, Lauren J and Alonso-Coello, Pablo and
              Meerpohl, Joerg J and Vandvik, Per Olav and Brozek, Jan L and Akl,
