  journal  = "J. Clin. Epidemiol.",
  volume   =  90,
  pages    = "37--42",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND AND OBJECTIVE: Advanced analytic methods for
              synthesizing evidence about complex interventions continue to be
              developed. In this paper, we emphasize that the specific research
              question posed in the review should be used as a guide for
              choosing the appropriate analytic method. METHODS: We present
              advanced analytic approaches that address four common questions
