              Attributes compiled from 26 methodological papers (2001-2014) were
              used as a framework for data extraction. Data were extracted into
              summary tables by one reviewer and then considered within the
              author team. RESULTS: We identified seven considerations
              determining choice of methods from the methodological literature,
              encapsulated within the mnemonic Review
              question-Epistemology-Time/Timescale-Resources-Expertise-Audience
