  volume   =  106,
  pages    = "70--79",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVE: An overview of systematic reviews (OoSRs) is a study
              designed to offer a broad view of evidence from existing
              systematic reviews (SRs). The abstract is an important part of an
              OoSRs as it can determine whether reading the full text is of
