              Systematic Reviews as Topic; Data; Data extraction; Discrepancies;
              Errors; Reporting; Systematic reviews",
  doi      = "10.1016/j.jclinepi.2019.09.003",
  pmid     =  31541692,
  issn     = "0895-4356,1878-5921",
  language = "en",
  annote   = "RAYYAN-INCLUSION: ``Stefan''=>``Included''"
}

@ARTICLE{Speich2020a,
