              widely used in not only systematic reviews and meta-analyses but
              also observational studies and clinical trials. In this study, we
              aimed to show readers the various uses of forest plots in
              displaying analysis results. STUDY DESIGN AND SETTING: We used a
              tutorial type to show multiple uses of forest plots in
