              results can promote more effective use of PROs in practice. STUDY
              DESIGN AND SETTING: A recent supplement to Medical Care describes
              various approaches to address challenges in interpreting and
              acting on PROs in practice and therefore serves as a ``PRO-cision
              Medicine Methods Tool kit.'' This commentary provides an overview
