              Assessment, Risk Factors, Sex Characteristics, Survival Analysis,
              Bias (Epidemiology); Censoring; Competing risk analysis;
              Cumulative incidence; Epidemiological methods; Hazard",
  doi      = "10.1016/j.jclinepi.2020.03.004",
  pmid     =  32165133,
  issn     = "0895-4356,1878-5921",
