  volume   =  130,
  pages    = "156--160",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVES: Scoping reviews are being increasingly used by
              researchers. The objective of this article was to outline some
              challenges and potential solutions to improve the conduct and
              reporting of scoping reviews. STUDY DESIGN AND SETTING: The JBI
              scoping review methodology group consists of 9 experts in the
