               drug trials in light of Real World Evidence generation",
  author    = "Zuidgeest, Mira G P and Goetz, Iris and Meinecke, Anna-Katharina
               and Boateng, Daniel and Irving, Elaine A and van Thiel, Ghislaine
               J M and Welsing, Paco M J and Oude-Rengerink, Katrien and
