               Assessment of Diagnostic Accuracy Studies-Comparative (QUADAS-C),
               Quality Assessment of Prognostic Accuracy Studies (QUAPAS), Risk
               Of Bias in Non-randomised Studies of Exposures (ROBINS-E), and
               the COnsensus-based Standards for the selection of health
