  volume   =  36,
  number   =  2,
  pages    = "191--199",
  abstract = "Actigraphy has become a valuable clinical and research tool to
              objectively evaluate sleep, daytime activity, and circadian
              activity rhythms in healthy individuals as well as persons with
              primary and comorbid insomnia. However, procedures used for
              sampling, data processing, and analysis are not consistently
