  journal   = "Value Health",
  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    =  27,
  number    =  4,
  pages     = "383--396",
  abstract  = "OBJECTIVES: Digital health definitions are abundant, but often
               lack clarity and precision. We aimed to develop a minimum
               information framework to define patient-facing digital health
               interventions (DHIs) for outcomes research. METHODS: Definitions
               of digital-health-related terms (DHTs) were systematically
