               Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality Measures, and the
               World Health Organization's Classification of Digital Health
               Interventions. Subsequently, we conducted an online Delphi study
               to establish a minimum information framework, which was pilot
               tested by 5 experts using hypothetical examples. RESULTS: After
               screening 2610 records and 545 full-text articles, we identified
               101 unique definitions of 67 secondary DHTs in 76 articles,
               resulting in 95 different patterns of concepts among the
               definitions. World Health Organization system (84.5\%), message
