               versatile tool, intended to assist authors in designing and
               reporting primary studies and evidence syntheses, yielding
               actionable results for clinicians and other decision makers.",
  month     =  apr,
  year      =  2024,
  url       = "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jval.2024.01.009",
  keywords  = "PICOTS-ComTeC; definition; health economics and outcomes
