              healthcare professionals, the difference in competencies and goals
              creates challenges for collaboration and knowledge exchange. We
              aim to provide clinicians with a context and understanding of AI
              research by facilitating communication between creators,
              researchers, clinicians, and readers of medical AI and ML
              research.Methods and results - We present the common tasks,
              considerations, and pitfalls (both methodological and ethical)
              that clinicians will encounter in AI research. We discuss the
