               models. An R script is provided for the implementation of the
               linear mixed-effects model. CONCLUSIONS: Linear mixed-effects
               models can provide evolutional details of repeated measurements
               and give more valid estimates compared to linear regression
               models in the setting of cardio-thoracic surgery outcomes
