  volume   =  60,
  number   =  1,
  pages    = "95--103",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Pilot studies test the feasibility of methods and
              procedures to be used in larger-scale studies. Although numerous
              articles describe guidelines for the conduct of pilot studies, few
              have included specific feasibility indicators or strategies for
              evaluating multiple aspects of feasibility. In addition, using
