  journal   = "BMJ",
  publisher = "BMJ",
  volume    =  389,
  pages     = "e081123",
  abstract  = "BACKGROUND: Well designed and properly executed randomised trials
               are considered the most reliable evidence on the benefits of
               healthcare interventions. However, there is overwhelming evidence
