               set of items to be included in a report of a randomised trial.
               CONSORT was first published in 1996 and was updated in 2001 and
               2010. CONSORT comprises a checklist of essential items that
               should be included in reports of randomised trials and a diagram
               for documenting the flow of participants through a trial. The
