               elaboration, more detailed guidance on reporting, references to
               key empirical studies, an expanded checklist, and a link to a
               website for further information. The document is intended to be
               used in conjunction with the SPIRIT 2025 statement and serves as
               a resource for researchers planning a trial and for others
               interested in trial protocols. > “Readers should not have to
               infer what was probably done; they should be told explicitly.” >
