  abstract = "Implementation studies are often poorly reported and indexed,
              reducing their potential to inform initiatives to improve
              healthcare services. The Standards for Reporting Implementation
              Studies (StaRI) initiative aimed to develop guidelines for
              transparent and accurate reporting of implementation studies.
