              and Nieuwlaat, Robby and Ford, Nathan and Stevens, Adrienne and
              Khabsa, Joanne and Nasir, Zil and Leontiadis, Grigorios and
              Meerpohl, Joerg and Piggott, Thomas and Qaseem, Amir and Matthews,
              Micayla and Schünemann, Holger J and {eCOVID-19 recommendations
