  journal  = "BMJ Evid Based Med",
  volume   =  28,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "418--423",
  abstract = "This paper is part of a series of methodological guidance from the
              Cochrane Rapid Reviews Methods Group (RRMG). Rapid reviews (RRs)
              use modified systematic review (SR) methods to accelerate the
              review process while maintaining systematic, transparent and
              reproducible methods to ensure integrity. This paper addresses
              considerations around the acceleration of study selection, data
