               guideline development: clarification of the purpose, designs and
               relevant methods",
  author    = "Flemming, Kate and Booth, Andrew and Garside, Ruth and Tunçalp,
               Özge and Noyes, Jane",
  journal   = "BMJ Glob. Health",
