  journal  = "BMJ Open",
  volume   =  7,
  number   =  12,
  pages    = "e018647",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVES: We examined major issues associated with sharing of
              individual clinical trial data and developed a consensus document
              on providing access to individual participant data from clinical
              trials, using a broad interdisciplinary approach. DESIGN AND
              METHODS: This was a consensus-building process among the members
