  pages    = "e036348",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVES: To make informed decisions about healthcare, patients
              and the public, health professionals and policymakers need
              information about the effects of interventions. People need
              information that is based on the best available evidence; that is
              presented in a complete and unbiased way; and that is relevant,
