  pages    = "224--254",
  abstract = "The relationship between two independent binomial proportions is
              commonly estimated and presented using the difference between
              proportions, the number needed to treat, the ratio of proportions
              or the odds ratio. Several different confidence intervals are
              available, but they can produce markedly different results. Some
