              used dependent variables (post-test score, absolute change score,
              relative change score, residual score), five regression models,
              eight sample sizes, and four levels of reliability. RESULTS: Our
              results indicated that a regression model including the
              investigated predictor, Group (experimental vs. control), pre-test
