  journal  = "BMC Med.",
  volume   =  13,
  pages    =  298,
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Individual participant data (IPD) from completed
              clinical trials should be responsibly shared to support efficient
              clinical research, generate new knowledge and bring benefit to
              patients. The Medical Research Council (MRC) Hubs for Trials
              Methodology Research (HTMR) has developed guidance to facilitate
              the sharing of IPD from publicly funded clinical trials. METHODS:
