              Ritchie, Craig W and Flicker, Leon and Cullum, Sarah J and Davis,
              Daniel and Quinn, Terence J and Hyde, Chris and Rutjes, Anne W S
              and Smailagic, Nadja and Marcus, Sue and Black, Sandra and
