  volume   =  11,
  number   =  5,
  pages    = "E316--22",
  abstract = "The causal factors of the systemic inflammatory response to
              cardiopulmonary bypass (CPB) were correctly identified in the
              early 1990 s: ``... activation of complement, coagulation,
              fibrinolytic, and kallikrein cascades, activation of neutrophils
              with degranulation and protease enzyme release, oxygen radical
              production, and the synthesis of various cytokines from
