  number   =  4,
  pages    = "e126",
  abstract = "BACKGROUND: Web-based and mobile health interventions (also called
              ``Internet interventions'' or ``ehealth/mhealth interventions'')
              are tools or treatments, typically behaviorally based, that are
              operationalized and transformed for delivery via the Internet or
              mobile platforms. These include electronic tools for patients,
