              Consensus on Exercise Reporting Template (CERT). DESIGN AND
              METHODS: Using the EQUATOR Network's methodological framework, 137
              exercise experts were invited to participate in a Delphi consensus
              study. A list of 41 items was identified from a meta-epidemiologic
