              is challenging. To address this challenge, a critical appraisal
              tool was developed: the Mixed Methods Appraisal Tool (MMAT). The
              aim of this paper is to present the enhancements made to the MMAT.
              DEVELOPMENT: The MMAT was initially developed in 2006 based on a
              literature review on systematic reviews combining qualitative and
              quantitative evidence. It was subject to pilot and interrater
