  volume    =  178,
  number    =  10,
  pages     = "1451--1463",
  abstract  = "Electronic health record (EHR) data are increasingly used to
               develop prediction models that guide clinical decision making at
               the point of care. These include algorithms that use
               high-frequency data, like in sepsis prediction, as well as
               simpler equations, such as the Pooled Cohort Equations for
