               benefits and harms in decision making ({GRADE} guidance 42)",
  author    = "Wiercioch, Wojtek and Morgano, Gian Paolo and Piggott, Thomas and
               Nieuwlaat, Robby and Neumann, Ignacio and Sousa-Pinto, Bernardo
               and Alonso-Coello, Pablo and Akl, Elie A and Mbuagbaw, Lawrence
               and Mirzayev, Fuad and Moja, Lorenzo and Mustafa, Reem and
               Piovani, Daniele and Parmelli, Elena and Saz-Parkinson, Zuleika
               and Schumacher, Samuel G and Verstijnen, Ilse and Bonovas,
